      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Planta Aquática. A folha na cabeça de Lotad repele sujeira naturalmente e permanece limpa até depois de transportar Pokémon cobertos de lama. Esses Pokémon se reúnem em lagos de água limpa, cuja superfície às vezes fica completamente coberta por suas folhas.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Grama, Água 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Lotad pode evoluir para Lombre no nível 5 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Astonish, Growl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Absorb, Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Bubble</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Natural Gift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Mist</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Flail, Mega Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Bubble Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Leech Seed, Nature Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Rain Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Giga Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Energy Ball</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Blizzard, Body Slam, Bullet Seed, Chilling Water, Confide, Disarming Voice, Double Team, Double-Edge, Echoed Voice, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Hail, Hidden Power, Ice Beam, Icy Wind, Magical Leaf, Muddy Water, Nature Power, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Scald, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Surf, Swagger, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Trailblaze, Uproar, Water Pulse, Weather Ball, Whirlpool, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Counter, Flail, Giga Drain, Leech Seed, Razor Leaf, Sweet Scent, Synthesis, Teeter Dance, Tickle, Water Gun</p>",
